"create_time": 1771676271, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "谢谢九月宣传甘肃呜呜呜呜呜[流泪]我哭死", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "8", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAb4_aNWFzyemb_lpHqVrdgg_6IHPicNyEn2-hu_sJUbQLk5QPj7YWtMP5ZstDmK14", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAb4_aNWFzyemb_lpHqVrdgg_6IHPicNyEn2-hu_sJUbQLk5QPj7YWtMP5ZstDmK14", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "98426H537346", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Callista", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_osn9MLAIIXGAeguL43KfBpxjNAeT2DAAElGKeB.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609197380399104831", "create_time": 1771654328, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "看到那个男娃娃说\"这里太旱了\"，眼泪一下子就下来了，作为甘肃人，我清楚这片土地的真实模样。看着九月姐姐踩高跷、在烟花烂漫的夜里走，突然明白——我们有的不是\"景点\"，是活着的历史。旱是真的旱，但旱地里长出的社火，一耍就是几千年。这份厚重，我们自己得记着。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "73", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAppIyQfxr41Pt-KKQQ3Jy-U3i0tvYPEj4tNzxWElzReg4IpqSl_9JL0SsKIRX5h2C", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAppIyQfxr41Pt-KKQQ3Jy-U3i0tvYPEj4tNzxWElzReg4IpqSl_9JL0SsKIRX5h2C", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "20474883395", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "发财很发财", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_ooUPafAIIpGAnESLiYEfDPFwzAlB7BAAEYh2eZ.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609687966068638522", "create_time": 1771768549, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "Welcome to 📍 甘肃·陇西", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "63", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAbvpeptDmvEhnsvWLGsNFp8uga4S2FfT4fUZImA52N2-nAThqltKxjOmHGf3OAl1k", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAbvpeptDmvEhnsvWLGsNFp8uga4S2FfT4fUZImA52N2-nAThqltKxjOmHGf3OAl1k", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "yjy080103", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "佳心饼干.🐾", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_458c3f7a94c91f1e26eba4e88e4d1d46.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "6", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609196001938113330", "create_time": 1771654006, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "甘肃人在哪？报数", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "552", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAyGIcb5eSBbV9F-zfaW8ZbY9j5T3Rtk1YDmXhFgZ6jhg", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAyGIcb5eSBbV9F-zfaW8ZbY9j5T3Rtk1YDmXhFgZ6jhg", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "83247228070", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "一觉睡到自然醒", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_o0EAQC1fpEbIjJA9nInqRAFAWAcDQEgAA37e9C.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "128", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609231867182744378", "create_time": 1771662355, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "真的泪目了，好像看到了小时候的我自己，很多人听到甘肃第一个印象就是穷，甘肃确实很穷，好像甘肃人生下来就是离开甘肃，可是这片土地养育了一代又一代的人，很多人走出甘肃都不会回来。这片土地养育的人都很老实，小时候也有外地姐姐来我家里面，我当时太小不太懂思念和不舍，只记得是一个外地姐姐，她带来了很多我没有见过的东西，给我买了很多的新衣服，没有人对我那么好过，几天过后，她走了，我不知道她去了哪里，我问我妈妈，妈妈说她去了南方，小孩子心里什么都不懂，他只希望你平平安安，留下一些思念和不舍，和一些回忆", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "61", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAimNzOafqERrPkbcH1ZcWEatD6S1EoRR3TWtibLa8UpqF6ohJpqLDaBWm0urS0KJm", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAimNzOafqERrPkbcH1ZcWEatD6S1EoRR3TWtibLa8UpqF6ohJpqLDaBWm0urS0KJm", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "21903722794", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "小郑的小迷妹🌰-🌽", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oQf1soeDA2BZaPziHliqQEASE4AXIwEz8IAePA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609226198237479695", "create_time": 1771661036, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "甘肃省定西市陇西县，华夏李氏发祥地，联合国教科文组织考察过后撂下一句话：“人类无法生存的地域”。但是那迷人的老祖宗还是将双手双脚勤恳的插在了这块贫瘠的土地上，土地的贫瘠哪怕是用汗水都没办法保护好一颗秧苗，山川沟壑比祖宗脸上的褶皱还要深，一度接近沙漠化趋势，但是经过无数先辈的拼搏试种了各种苗木后选中以洋芋为基本作物让土地的肥力慢慢上升，西北的土地没法孕育出黑土地富饶的农作物，但是孕育了不屈不挠向天争命的黄土人。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "387", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAwxqTi2XoZbdo4Hn7UIhtnaP4F4y3SJqDuOGXLUcUPDU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAwxqTi2XoZbdo4Hn7UIhtnaP4F4y3SJqDuOGXLUcUPDU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dyl149eubttj", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "滔滔不绝", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_0e3c7192812ae5983b55df74c5a44dfd.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "7", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609192941287359269", "create_time": 1771653293, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "这个小男孩特别真诚[流泪][流泪][流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "256", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAh98d6hbjJFT36Enb587Yoyx-IXY2yyVZafY-0GMDOis", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAh98d6hbjJFT36Enb587Yoyx-IXY2yyVZafY-0GMDOis", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "152354029", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "麦子色系", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oIG3AieRAfkAOLABC2jEAVGbIAIBAE5A7eAArF.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "6", "last_modify_ts": 1794419700340}, {"comment_id": "7609193766791955215", "create_time": 1771653484, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7609158131590925614", "content": "感谢逆水寒和九月一起宣传甘肃传统文化！高烨伞美！窗花也是极好的！！能同时玩游戏又喜欢九月真的是太荣幸啦~祝大家都平安顺遂[抱抱你][抱抱你]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count"